    <briefdescription>
<para>Data table row for shop-playable characters (<computeroutput>DT_Characters</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>DT_ShopCharacters</computeroutput>). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Speaker/customer links are intentionally component-driven on the spawned pawn Blueprint (<computeroutput>UParleySpeakerComponent</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>UARCustomerComponent</computeroutput>).</para>
<para>Identity tag contract:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>CharacterTag</computeroutput> (<computeroutput>Shop.Character.*</computeroutput>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>CustomerTag</computeroutput> (<computeroutput>Shop.Customer.*</computeroutput>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>SpeakerTag</computeroutput> (<computeroutput>Parley.Speaker.*</computeroutput>) These tags should mirror only by the first segment under the root (for example <computeroutput>Brother</computeroutput> in <computeroutput>Shop.Character.Brother.*</computeroutput>), while deeper subleafs may diverge per-system. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
